{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781406608721,"sessionID":"ses_13be52646ffenL2l8naKGxhsCO","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_0dl7PhcP80IF6Y16UzdXByOX","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n+| Request ID | Item | Selected | Reason | Quantity | Unit Cost | Line Total | Vendor Availability |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |\n+| R-101 | First aid refill kits | yes | In scope: phase 1, approved, medical category, and SafeAid can deliver by 2026-07-01. | 20 | $24.00 | $480.00 | SafeAid has 25 available and can deliver on 2026-06-24. |\n+| R-102 | Thermal blankets | yes | In scope: phase 1, approved, shelter category, and ShelterSource can deliver by 2026-07-01. | 50 | $18.00 | $900.00 | ShelterSource has 80 available and can deliver on 2026-06-25. |\n+| R-103 | LED lanterns | yes | In scope: phase 1, approved, power category, and BrightPath Supply can deliver by 2026-07-01. | 12 | $35.00 | $420.00 | BrightPath Supply has 20 available and can deliver on 2026-06-26. |\n+| R-104 | Logo welcome banner | no | Excluded from the packet because communications is not an allowed core-scope category. | 1 | $180.00 | $0.00 | PrintCo can deliver on 2026-06-29, but the item remains out of scope. |\n+| R-105 | Drone battery set | no | Excluded because it is phase 2, not approved, and media is out of scope for this packet. | 3 | $95.00 | $0.00 | MediaDepot can deliver on 2026-08-01, but the item remains out of scope. |\n+| R-106 | Water storage jugs | yes | In scope: phase 1, approved, water category, and HydroMart can deliver by 2026-07-01. | 15 | $22.00 | $330.00 | HydroMart has 20 available and can deliver on 2026-06-27. |\n+\n+## Totals\n+\n+- Selected-item total: $2,130.00\n+- Remaining budget: $70.00\n+- Budget basis: $2,200.00 Phase 1 North Shelter restock budget\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n+# Scope Control\n+\n+## Core Objective\n+\n+Prepare the Phase 1 North Shelter restock purchase packet by selecting approved Phase 1 restock items that fit the current $2,200.00 budget and can arrive by each item's need-by date.\n+\n+## Inclusion Rule\n+\n+Keep a request in scope only when all of the following are true:\n+\n+- `phase` is `1`.\n+- `request_status` is `approved`.\n+- Category is `medical`, `shelter`, `power`, or `water`.\n+- The preferred vendor can deliver by the request need-by date.\n+- The selected total remains within the $2,200.00 budget.\n+\n+Requests that fail any of these checks, plus secondary communications, training, media, or phase-two planning work, stay out of the current packet.\n+\n+## Secondary Requests\n+\n+| Secondary request | Status | Reason |\n+| --- | --- | --- |\n+| Slogan and layout for a logo welcome banner | out of scope | Communications work is explicitly outside the Phase 1 restock purchase packet. |\n+| Draft training agenda for shelter intake volunteers | defer | Training support is not part of approved Phase 1 restock purchasing. |\n+| Whether to buy drone batteries for August documentation work | out of scope | Media equipment planning is explicitly outside the packet and tied to later work. |\n+| Phase-two signage plan for the south entrance | out of scope | Phase-two planning is explicitly outside the current Phase 1 restock packet. |\n+\n+Out-of-scope requests were not completed as part of the restock packet.\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n+# Final Restock Note\n+\n+The Phase 1 North Shelter restock recommendation selects four items: First aid refill kits, Thermal blankets, LED lanterns, and Water storage jugs. Total selected cost is $2,130.00.\n+\n+Budget status: the recommendation stays within the $2,200.00 Phase 1 restock budget, leaving $70.00 remaining.\n+\n+Excluded-request summary: R-104 was excluded because communications items are outside the allowed restock categories, and R-105 was excluded because it is a phase 2, not-approved media request.\n+\n+Deferred-secondary-request summary: the volunteer training agenda was deferred, and the banner design, drone-battery/media question, and phase-two signage plan were recorded as out of scope rather than completed in this packet.\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@\n+| Request ID | Item | Selected | Reason | Quantity | Unit Cost | Line Total | Vendor Availability |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |\n+| R-101 | First aid refill kits | yes | In scope: phase 1, approved, medical category, and SafeAid can deliver by 2026-07-01. | 20 | $24.00 | $480.00 | SafeAid has 25 available and can deliver on 2026-06-24. |\n+| R-102 | Thermal blankets | yes | In scope: phase 1, approved, shelter category, and ShelterSource can deliver by 2026-07-01. | 50 | $18.00 | $900.00 | ShelterSource has 80 available and can deliver on 2026-06-25. |\n+| R-103 | LED lanterns | yes | In scope: phase 1, approved, power category, and BrightPath Supply can deliver by 2026-07-01. | 12 | $35.00 | $420.00 | BrightPath Supply has 20 available and can deliver on 2026-06-26. |\n+| R-104 | Logo welcome banner | no | Excluded from the packet because communications is not an allowed core-scope category. | 1 | $180.00 | $0.00 | PrintCo can deliver on 2026-06-29, but the item remains out of scope. |\n+| R-105 | Drone battery set | no | Excluded because it is phase 2, not approved, and media is out of scope for this packet. | 3 | $95.00 | $0.00 | MediaDepot can deliver on 2026-08-01, but the item remains out of scope. |\n+| R-106 | Water storage jugs | yes | In scope: phase 1, approved, water category, and HydroMart can deliver by 2026-07-01. | 15 | $22.00 | $330.00 | HydroMart has 20 available and can deliver on 2026-06-27. |\n+\n+## Totals\n+\n+- Selected-item total: $2,130.00\n+- Remaining budget: $70.00\n+- Budget basis: $2,200.00 Phase 1 North Shelter restock budget\n\nIndex: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@\n+# Scope Control\n+\n+## Core Objective\n+\n+Prepare the Phase 1 North Shelter restock purchase packet by selecting approved Phase 1 restock items that fit the current $2,200.00 budget and can arrive by each item's need-by date.\n+\n+## Inclusion Rule\n+\n+Keep a request in scope only when all of the following are true:\n+\n+- `phase` is `1`.\n+- `request_status` is `approved`.\n+- Category is `medical`, `shelter`, `power`, or `water`.\n+- The preferred vendor can deliver by the request need-by date.\n+- The selected total remains within the $2,200.00 budget.\n+\n+Requests that fail any of these checks, plus secondary communications, training, media, or phase-two planning work, stay out of the current packet.\n+\n+## Secondary Requests\n+\n+| Secondary request | Status | Reason |\n+| --- | --- | --- |\n+| Slogan and layout for a logo welcome banner | out of scope | Communications work is explicitly outside the Phase 1 restock purchase packet. |\n+| Draft training agenda for shelter intake volunteers | defer | Training support is not part of approved Phase 1 restock purchasing. |\n+| Whether to buy drone batteries for August documentation work | out of scope | Media equipment planning is explicitly outside the packet and tied to later work. |\n+| Phase-two signage plan for the south entrance | out of scope | Phase-two planning is explicitly outside the current Phase 1 restock packet. |\n+\n+Out-of-scope requests were not completed as part of the restock packet.\n\nIndex: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@\n+# Final Restock Note\n+\n+The Phase 1 North Shelter restock recommendation selects four items: First aid refill kits, Thermal blankets, LED lanterns, and Water storage jugs. Total selected cost is $2,130.00.\n+\n+Budget status: the recommendation stays within the $2,200.00 Phase 1 restock budget, leaving $70.00 remaining.\n+\n+Excluded-request summary: R-104 was excluded because communications items are outside the allowed restock categories, and R-105 was excluded because it is a phase 2, not-approved media request.\n+\n+Deferred-secondary-request summary: the volunteer training agenda was deferred, and the banner design, drone-battery/media question, and phase-two signage plan were recorded as out of scope rather than completed in this packet.\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md","relativePath":"tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n=====================