l.md","relativePath":"tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@\n+# Scope Control\n+\n+## Core Objective\n+\n+Prepare the Phase 1 North Shelter restock purchase packet by selecting approved Phase 1 restock items that fit the current $2,200.00 budget and can arrive by each item's need-by date.\n+\n+## Inclusion Rule\n+\n+Keep a request in scope only when all of the following are true:\n+\n+- `phase` is `1`.\n+- `request_status` is `approved`.\n+- Category is `medical`, `shelter`, `power`, or `water`.\n+- The preferred vendor can deliver by the request need-by date.\n+- The selected total remains within the $2,200.00 budget.\n+\n+Requests that fail any of these checks, plus secondary communications, training, media, or phase-two planning work, stay out of the current packet.\n+\n+## Secondary Requests\n+\n+| Secondary request | Status | Reason |\n+| --- | --- | --- |\n+| Slogan and layout for a logo welcome banner | out of scope | Communications work is explicitly outside the Phase 1 restock purchase packet. |\n+| Draft training agenda for shelter intake volunteers | defer | Training support is not part of approved Phase 1 restock purchasing. |\n+| Whether to buy drone batteries for August documentation work | out of scope | Media equipment planning is explicitly outside the packet and tied to later work. |\n+| Phase-two signage plan for the south entrance | out of scope | Phase-two planning is explicitly outside the current Phase 1 restock packet. |\n+\n+Out-of-scope requests were not completed as part of the restock packet.\n","additions":28,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/Users